{"version":1,"content":"<p>收藏卡評級機構PSA公佈10月13日失竊案的新進展：超過200個包裹從停在美國加州聖安娜PSA總部外的一輛FedEx卡車中被盜，失物包括寶可夢及體育收藏卡。警方此前估算涉案價值接近100萬美元，PSA現已確認失竊清單涉及6451件物品。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583892.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:00:22.023878+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:36:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:07.067800+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:07.067800+00:00","content_hash":"cfb9184d20589ad1b3ab9193c09aa55cc32ebf13c50111c5ac7aa88a026dd1aa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}